[% PageVersion = '3d/printer_control.tt,v 0.02 2026/09/24 shanta Exp shanta' %]
[% IF c.session.debug_mode == 1 %][% PageVersion %][% END %]

<div class="app-container">
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Printer control</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">[% printer.name | html %] — [% lan_host | html %]</p>
  </div>

  [% IF c.flash.error_msg %]
  <p class="app-flash-error">[% c.flash.error_msg | html %]</p>
  [% END %]
  [% IF c.flash.success_msg %]
  <p class="app-flash-success">[% c.flash.success_msg | html %]</p>
  [% END %]

  <p>
    <a href="/3d/printers">Printer farm</a>
    |
    <a href="/3d/printer_lan/control?printer_id=[% printer.id %]">Refresh now</a>
    (manual — auto-reload was looping a browser Allow/OK dialog)
  </p>

  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>Camera</h2>
      <p>The picture below is the live stream. It does not start until you click Show in page, so opening this screen does not steal the camera. One viewer only — close VLC or another tab first. If the box stays black, press Start camera, then Show in page again.</p>
      <div data-printer-flv data-flv-url="http://[% lan_host | html %]:18088/flv">
        <video controls muted playsinline></video>
        <p>
          <button type="button" class="btn" data-printer-flv-play>Show in page</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn" data-printer-flv-stop>Release camera</button>
          <span data-printer-flv-status></span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" class="app-form" style="display:inline;">
        <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
        <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="camera_start">
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Start camera</button>
      </form>
      <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" class="app-form" style="display:inline;">
        <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
        <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="camera_stop">
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Stop camera</button>
      </form>
      <p>VLC/mpv URL: <code>http://[% lan_host | html %]:18088/flv</code></p>
    </div>

    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>Identity (HTTP /info)</h2>
      <table class="data-table">
        <tr><th>Model</th><td>[% state.model_name | html %] ([% state.model_id | html %])</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Serial</th><td>[% state.serial | html %]</td></tr>
        <tr><th>LAN mode</th><td>[% state.ctrl_type | html %]</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Host</th><td>[% state.host | html %]:18910</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>Live state (LAN MQTT)</h2>
      [% IF state.error %]
      <p>[% state.error | html %]</p>
      [% END %]
      [% IF state.mqtt_ok %]
      <table class="data-table">
        <tr><th>Printer state</th><td>[% state.print_state || '—' | html %]</td></tr>
        <tr><th>File</th><td>[% state.filename || '—' | html %]</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Progress</th>
          <td>[% IF state.progress != '' %][% state.progress | html %] %[% ELSE %]—[% END %]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr><th>Layer</th>
          <td>
            [% IF state.curr_layer.defined %][% state.curr_layer | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]
            /
            [% IF state.total_layers.defined %][% state.total_layers | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr><th>Time (min)</th>
          <td>
            printed [% IF state.print_time_min.defined %][% state.print_time_min | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]
            · remaining [% IF state.remain_time_min.defined %][% state.remain_time_min | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr><th>Nozzle</th>
          <td>
            [% IF state.nozzle_temp.defined %][% state.nozzle_temp | html %] °C[% ELSE %]—[% END %]
            / target [% IF state.target_nozzle.defined %][% state.target_nozzle | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr><th>Bed</th>
          <td>
            [% IF state.bed_temp.defined %][% state.bed_temp | html %] °C[% ELSE %]—[% END %]
            / target [% IF state.target_bed.defined %][% state.target_bed | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]
          </td>
        </tr>
        [% IF state.firmware %]
        <tr><th>Firmware</th><td>[% state.firmware | html %]</td></tr>
        [% END %]
      </table>
      [% ELSE %]
      <p>MQTT did not return a report. Identity above still came from HTTP /info. Controls need the local MQTT broker.</p>
      [% END %]
    </div>

    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>What can be changed outside the slicer</h2>
      <p>The slicer asks for leveling, AI detection, filament color, and flow when it sends a job. The printer screen can set several of those again on a reprint, and it can change temperature, flow, and speed while a job is running. Dryer start works from the slicer and from the printer console. This page should grow those controls carefully. A control is missing because the command is not wired yet, or because the last send used a bad payload — not because the setting is forbidden.</p>
      <table class="data-table">
        <tr><th>Setting</th><th>Printer screen</th><th>Slicer device panel</th><th>This page</th></tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Camera</td>
          <td>Yes</td>
          <td>Yes, live view</td>
          <td>Yes. Show in page. One viewer.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Pause, resume, stop</td>
          <td>Yes, during a print</td>
          <td>Yes, during a print</td>
          <td>Yes</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Start a file already on the printer</td>
          <td>Yes</td>
          <td>Send dialog: leveling, AI, color</td>
          <td>Filename only. No leveling, AI, or color dialog.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Auto level</td>
          <td>Yes, when idle, and again on a reprint</td>
          <td>Asked at send. Also stored in the sliced file.</td>
          <td>Not wired. The screen and a reprint can still set it.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>AI detection</td>
          <td>Yes, when not in LAN mode</td>
          <td>Asked at send</td>
          <td>Not available. Anycubic turns AI detection off while LAN mode is on.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Filament color and type</td>
          <td>Yes, when idle. RFID spools are fixed. Third-party rolls are set here.</td>
          <td>Asked at send. Maps colors onto the slots.</td>
          <td>Read only. Color cannot be edited during a print. A slot write is not sent from here.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Nozzle and bed temperature</td>
          <td>Yes, including during a print</td>
          <td>Set in the slice. Tune during a print on some panels.</td>
          <td>Read only. Targets are shown. A temperature write is not proven on this unit.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Dryer start and stop</td>
          <td>Yes</td>
          <td>Yes. This works from the slicer.</td>
          <td>Removed after one LAN send disconnected the ACE. Likely our payload, or a one-time glitch. Not a permanent ban.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Flow and speed</td>
          <td>Tune menu during a print</td>
          <td>Yes. The slicer can set flow. On this printer that includes a PETG flow value whose effect is not yet known.</td>
          <td>Not wired. Not banned.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>ACE dryer</h2>
      <p>The % column is the ACE's own remaining-filament report (<code>consumables_percent</code>). This app does not calculate it from print usage. A dash means the spool did not report a percent — usually a non-RFID roll. Color and type are also whatever the ACE last reported. Official RFID spools cannot be edited. Setting a stock color over LAN is not wired yet: the last unverified ACE command disconnected the dryer, so this page will not send a slot write until that command is proven.</p>
      [% IF state.ace_ok %]
      <table class="data-table">
        <tr><th>Box temp</th><td>[% IF state.ace_temp.defined %][% state.ace_temp | html %] °C[% ELSE %]—[% END %]</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Humidity</th><td>[% IF state.ace_humidity.defined %][% state.ace_humidity | html %] %[% ELSE %]—[% END %]</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Drying</th>
          <td>
            [% IF state.drying_active %]on[% ELSE %]off[% END %]
            [% IF state.drying_target.defined %] · target [% state.drying_target | html %] °C[% END %]
            [% IF state.drying_remain.defined %] · remain [% state.drying_remain | html %] min[% END %]
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr><th>Loaded slot</th><td>[% IF state.ace_loaded_slot.defined %][% state.ace_loaded_slot | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]</td></tr>
      </table>
      [% IF state.ace_slots.size %]
      <table class="data-table">
        <tr><th>Slot</th><th>Material</th><th>Color</th><th>%</th></tr>
        [% FOREACH s IN state.ace_slots %]
        <tr>
          <td>[% s.index | html %]</td>
          <td>[% s.type || '—' | html %]</td>
          <td>[% IF s.color.defined %][% s.color | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]</td>
          <td>[% IF s.pct.defined %][% s.pct | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]</td>
        </tr>
        [% END %]
      </table>
      [% END %]
      [% ELSE %]
      <p>ACE did not answer. That can mean it is idle, or that it is still reconnecting after the dryer command. Do not press Start dryer — that button is removed.</p>
      [% END %]
    </div>

    <div class="app-section">
      <details>
      <summary><h2>Files on the printer</h2></summary>
      <p>Open this only when you need a file. Search, then use Back and Next. Twenty names at a time.</p>
      <p>
        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/3d/printer_lan/control', { printer_id => printer.id, storage => 'local', path => state.file_path, q => state.file_q }) %]" class="[% IF state.file_storage == 'local' %]btn btn-primary[% ELSE %]btn[% END %]">Local</a>
        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/3d/printer_lan/control', { printer_id => printer.id, storage => 'udisk', path => state.file_path, q => state.file_q }) %]" class="[% IF state.file_storage == 'udisk' %]btn btn-primary[% ELSE %]btn[% END %]">USB / SSD</a>
      </p>
      <form method="get" action="/3d/printer_lan/control" class="app-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
        <input type="hidden" name="storage" value="[% state.file_storage | html %]">
        <input type="hidden" name="path" value="[% state.file_path | html %]">
        <label>Search <input type="search" name="q" value="[% state.file_q | html %]"></label>
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Search</button>
        [% IF state.file_q %]
        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/3d/printer_lan/control', { printer_id => printer.id, storage => state.file_storage, path => state.file_path }) %]">Clear</a>
        [% END %]
      </form>
      <p>Path: <a href="[% c.uri_for('/3d/printer_lan/control', { printer_id => printer.id, storage => state.file_storage, path => '/' }) %]">/</a>
        [% IF state.file_path && state.file_path != '/' %]
        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/3d/printer_lan/control', { printer_id => printer.id, storage => state.file_storage, path => state.file_parent }) %]">Up</a>
        [% END %]
        <code>[% state.file_path || '/' | html %]</code>
      </p>
      <p>[% state.file_from %]–[% state.file_to %] of [% state.file_total %]</p>

      [% SET ps = state.print_state | lower %]
      [% SET file_locked = !ps || (ps != 'free' && ps != 'finished' && ps != 'stopped' && ps != 'stoped') %]
      [% UNLESS file_locked %]
      <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/upload" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="app-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
        <label>Upload <input type="file" name="file" required></label>
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Upload</button>
      </form>
      [% ELSE %]
      <p class="app-flash-error">Upload is locked while the printer is not idle.</p>
      [% END %]
      [% IF file_locked %]
      <p class="app-flash-error">Printer is [% state.print_state || 'not confirmed idle' | html %]. File changes are locked so a delete, rename, move, upload, or new start cannot disturb the file being printed. Pause, resume, and stop still work.</p>
      [% END %]
      [% IF state.file_error %]
      <p class="app-flash-error">[% state.file_error | html %]</p>
      [% END %]

      [% IF state.file_rows.size %]
      <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th></th>
            <th>Name</th>
            <th>Size</th>
            <th>Actions (start, rename, move to subdir, delete)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          [%# Directories first for easy navigation %]
          [% FOREACH f IN state.file_rows %]
          [% IF f.is_dir %]
          <tr>
            <td><span class="pfb-ext pfb-ext-folder">DIR</span></td>
            <td class="pfb-name">
              <a href="/3d/printer_lan/control?printer_id=[% printer.id %]&amp;storage=[% state.file_storage | html %]&amp;path=[% f.open_path | uri %]">[% f.name | html %]/</a>
            </td>
            <td>—</td>
            <td class="pfb-actions">
              <span>Open the folder to use it as a move target.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          [% END %]
          [% END %]

          [%# Files %]
          [% FOREACH f IN state.file_rows %]
          [% IF !f.is_dir %]
          <tr>
            <td><span class="pfb-ext pfb-ext-gcode">GC</span></td>
            <td class="pfb-name">
              <div>[% f.name | html %]</div>
              [% UNLESS file_locked %]
              <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" style="margin-top:4px;">
                <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="rename">
                <input type="hidden" name="old" value="[% f.name | html %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="path" value="[% state.file_path | html %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="storage" value="[% state.file_storage | html %]">
                <input type="text" name="new" value="[% f.name | html %]" class="pfb-rename" size="80">
                <button type="submit" class="btn">Rename</button>
              </form>
              [% END %]
            </td>
            <td>[% IF f.size.defined %][% f.size | html %][% ELSE %]—[% END %]</td>
            <td class="pfb-actions">
              [% IF file_locked %]
              <span>Locked while printing</span>
              [% ELSE %]
              [% IF state.file_storage == 'local' %]
              <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" style="display:inline; font-size:0.65rem;">
                <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="start_print">
                <input type="hidden" name="filename" value="[% f.name | html %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="path" value="[% state.file_path | html %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="storage" value="[% state.file_storage | html %]">
                <label style="font-size:0.6rem;"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm_start" value="1"> start</label>

                <!-- Filament and cost settings directly in the printer file manager -->
                <select name="filament_item_id" style="font-size:0.6rem; max-width:110px;" title="Assign filament for tracking & cost">
                  <option value="">--filament--</option>
                  [% FOREACH fl IN state.filaments %]
                    <option value="[% fl.id %]">[% fl.name | html %]</option>
                  [% END %]
                </select>
                <input type="number" name="filament_quantity" step="0.1" style="width:50px; font-size:0.6rem;" placeholder="g" title="Grams (auto from 3MF)">
                <input type="number" name="print_hours" step="0.1" style="width:42px; font-size:0.6rem;" placeholder="h" title="Print hours">
                <input type="number" name="filament_cost" step="0.01" style="width:48px; font-size:0.6rem;" placeholder="$" title="Filament cost">

                <button type="submit" class="btn">Print</button>
              </form>
              [% END %]

              <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" style="display:inline;">
                <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="[% IF state.file_storage == 'udisk' %]delete_udisk[% ELSE %]delete_local[% END %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="filename" value="[% f.name | html %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="path" value="[% state.file_path | html %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="storage" value="[% state.file_storage | html %]">
                <label style="font-size:0.7rem;"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm_delete" value="1"> del</label>
                <button type="submit" class="btn">Delete</button>
              </form>

              <!-- Move into a folder the printer already has -->
              <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" style="display:inline; margin-top:1px;">
                <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="move">
                <input type="hidden" name="filename" value="[% f.name | html %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="from_path" value="[% state.file_path | html %]">
                <input type="hidden" name="storage" value="[% state.file_storage | html %]">
                <select name="to_path" style="font-size:0.7rem; width:110px;">
                  <option value="/">/ (root)</option>
                  [% FOREACH d IN state.file_dirs %]
                    [% SET target = (state.file_path == '/' ? '' : state.file_path) _ '/' _ d %]
                    <option value="[% target | html %]">[% d | html %]</option>
                  [% END %]
                </select>
                <button type="submit" class="btn">Move here</button>
              </form>
              [% END %]
            </td>
          </tr>
          [% END %]
          [% END %]
        </tbody>
      </table>
      [% IF state.file_pages > 1 %]
      <div class="pagination">
        [% IF state.file_page > 1 %]
        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/3d/printer_lan/control', { printer_id => printer.id, storage => state.file_storage, path => state.file_path, q => state.file_q, page => state.file_page - 1 }) %]">&lsaquo; Back</a>
        [% ELSE %]
        <a class="disabled">&lsaquo; Back</a>
        [% END %]
        <span class="page-current">[% state.file_page %]</span>
        <span class="page-info">of [% state.file_pages %]</span>
        [% IF state.file_page < state.file_pages %]
        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/3d/printer_lan/control', { printer_id => printer.id, storage => state.file_storage, path => state.file_path, q => state.file_q, page => state.file_page + 1 }) %]">Next &rsaquo;</a>
        [% ELSE %]
        <a class="disabled">Next &rsaquo;</a>
        [% END %]
      </div>
      [% END %]
      [% ELSE %]
      <p>No files in this folder (or the printer did not answer listLocal/listUdisk). Refresh after a slicer send or plug SSD.</p>
      [% END %]
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>Job control</h2>
      <p>Stop cancels the current job on the machine.</p>
      <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" class="app-form" style="display:inline;">
        <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
        <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="pause">
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Pause</button>
      </form>
      <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" class="app-form" style="display:inline;">
        <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
        <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="resume">
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Resume</button>
      </form>
      <form method="post" action="/3d/printer_lan/command" class="app-form" style="margin-top:0.8em;">
        <input type="hidden" name="printer_id" value="[% printer.id %]">
        <input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="stop">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="confirm_stop" value="1"> Cancel the print</label>
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Stop</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
